menu "TARS PCB V1.0"
    config TARS_LCD_BACKLIGHT_DRIVE
        bool "Drive shared LCD BLK after verifying module electrical input"
        default n
        help
            Enable only after confirming that both LCD modules provide a
            low-current logic BLK input with appropriate current limiting.
            Default: GPIO8 is high impedance; UI still renders to both panels.
endmenu
